<title>HONG KONG: High Fashion year net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>High Fashion year net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.2 gain     vs 5.1 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs 14.42 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    11.51 profit vs 18.15 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,387.9	vs 1,640.5</p>
<p>    Company name		 High Fashion International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 21-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - High Fashion is a maker of washable silk garments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
